{"version":1,"title":"标签：Verilog - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"navbar top\"><div class=\"navbar-blur\"><div class=\"navbar-container\"><nav class=\"post\"><a href=\"/\">近期发布</a><a href=\"/categories/\">分类</a><a class=\"active\" href=\"/tags/\">标签：Verilog</a><a href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><a href=\"/archives/\">归档</a><a href=\"/recent/\">BAKER</a></nav></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"post-list post\"><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/28be479a/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P7]Verilog 设计 MIPS 微系统</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>It's time to leave all behind.</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-08T14:48:21.000Z\">2025-12-08</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/905092e9/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P6]Verilog 设计五级流水线 CPU-2</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>我去，这才是我最接近 AK 的一次呃呃……</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-01T13:15:56.000Z\">2025-12-01</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/65cd5a9/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P5]Verilog 设计五级流水线 CPU</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>仍旧猛攻 1h 第三题未通过。不过所幸 P5 这道鬼门关一次过了，题也都抄下来了。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-24T13:17:38.000Z\">2025-11-24</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/53039668/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P4]Verilog 设计单周期 CPU</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>唉唉，又差一点把第三题做出来。猛攻 1h 以失败告终……不过起码通过了，开心~</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-17T13:19:44.000Z\">2025-11-17</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/fae59a6c/\">\n<article class=\"md-text